Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||11-19-2001||05:27 PM||||I want to paint my plastic panel that goes around the door and behind where the seatbelts at. does it just pull apart with clips or what? and with the dash. is it really diffucult to take out for painting? if its pretty hard I'll just leave it alone.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroBUZZ||11-19-2001||06:00 PM||||Pretty easy to do.  Start with the bottom one along the sill.  Everything is really straightforward, but a little repetitive. I make my son take them all out.  Just feel around for hidden clips and don't pull at them like a madman.  The seat belt bolt may be in pretty good.<P>before painting, be sure everything is CLEAN and wiped with alcohol or acetone.  Light coats work best.<BR>Gary||||reg||1
